+**Inputs and Outputs**
+*   **Input:** A 3D position $\mathbf{x} \in \mathbb{R}^3$ and a viewing direction $\mathbf{v}$.
+*   **Output:** Opacity $\sigma \in [0, 1]$, radiance color $\mathbf{c}$, and geometry features $\mathbf{f}_{geo}$.
 
